id: scam-riches
name: Riches +1 (Scam)
kind: conditions
maxStacks: 1
# Not a Combat Condition: the Scam Adventuring Maneuver's mark.
combatCondition: no
# "For 1 day" is story time, and nothing here counts days: the player ends it.
endedByHand: true
source: Core Rule
description: >
  A Scam paid off: your Riches are 1 higher for a day.
text: >
  Riches +1 (Scam): the Scam Adventuring Maneuver's mark. "Increase your Riches by 1 for 1 day."

---

# Read by the Wealth fold (adventure.mjs `richesNow`): while it is held, Riches count 1 more - up to 10 -
# for the Status and the Wealth Check. Ended when the day is over - Cancel buff on the Scam row, or from the
# Combat tab.
